  "content": [
    {
      "id": "summary-1",
      "kind": "summary",
      "text": "The team reviewed Colin's request for evaluation pricing across Echo's planned 28-location deployment. Alex approved a bounded $22 per-location rate for the first 10 locations during a 30-day evaluation only. She declined an open-ended exception and said standard pricing resumes unless Finance gives new approval. Colin will draft the order form by September 5.",
      "sequence": 0,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "origin": "source_ai",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-summary"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-01",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Thanks for making time. Colin asked for a quick finance read before he sends Echo another proposal. The question is whether we can make the evaluation pricing work without accidentally setting their long-term price.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "zhen",
      "sequence": 1,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:00:08.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:00:31.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 8000,
      "end_offset_ms": 31000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-02",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "They are asking for twenty-two dollars per location. They want it across all twenty-eight sites because their procurement team says a single rate is easier to approve. If we give them that now, I think we keep momentum for the September plan.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "colin-ellis",
      "sequence": 2,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:00:35.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:01:03.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 35000,
      "end_offset_ms": 63000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-03",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Before we get into price, the delivery plan is not twenty-eight locations at once. The operating plan is still a first group of ten, with a decision on expansion after the evaluation evidence is in.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "dana-lewis",
      "sequence": 3,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:01:09.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:01:31.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 69000,
      "end_offset_ms": 91000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-03"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-04",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Right. I am not comfortable granting an exception for twenty-eight locations before we know whether the first ten are successful. That turns an evaluation concession into the default commercial position.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "alex",
      "sequence": 4,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:01:38.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:02:04.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 98000,
      "end_offset_ms": 124000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-05",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Could we at least put the twenty-two dollar rate in the full order form and say the later locations are activated when they are ready? That would save them from reopening procurement next month.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "colin-ellis",
      "sequence": 5,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:02:12.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:02:36.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 132000,
      "end_offset_ms": 156000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-05"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-06",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "No. That still gives them a commitment for the whole deployment. I can approve twenty-two dollars per location for the initial ten locations, and only for a thirty-day evaluation. Nothing beyond that is implied.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "alex",
      "sequence": 6,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:02:43.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:03:12.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 163000,
      "end_offset_ms": 192000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-06"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-07",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "For the order form, I can make the evaluation term explicit and list ten activated locations. Do you want the other eighteen named anywhere, or should they stay out entirely?",
      "speaker_participant_id": "dana-lewis",
      "sequence": 7,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:03:19.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:03:42.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 199000,
      "end_offset_ms": 222000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.97,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-07"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-08",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Keep them out of the commercial commitment. You can describe a possible expansion discussion after the evaluation, but the order form must say standard pricing applies after thirty days unless Finance approves a new exception.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "alex",
      "sequence": 8,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:03:50.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:04:17.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 230000,
      "end_offset_ms": 257000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-08"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-09",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "That will be a harder conversation with Echo, but it is clear. We should also avoid calling this a rollout discount in any customer language, because it is tied to the evaluation.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "zhen",
      "sequence": 9,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:04:25.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:04:49.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 265000,
      "end_offset_ms": 289000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-09"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-10",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Agreed. I will frame it as an evaluation rate for the first ten locations. If the evaluation goes well, I will come back with the evidence and request a separate expansion approval rather than promising the same number now.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "colin-ellis",
      "sequence": 10,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:04:57.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:05:25.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 297000,
      "end_offset_ms": 325000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-10"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-11",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Please send me the draft before it goes out. I am looking for three things: ten locations, a thirty-day evaluation term, and the return to standard pricing. If any of those are missing, it is not the approved exception.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "alex",
      "sequence": 11,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:05:33.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:05:59.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 333000,
      "end_offset_ms": 359000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-11"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-12",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Colin, can you have that draft ready by September fifth? Dana can help with the location schedule, but you own getting the commercial language together and routing it to Alex.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "zhen",
      "sequence": 12,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:06:06.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:06:31.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 366000,
      "end_offset_ms": 391000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-12"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-13",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Yes, I will have the order form to Alex by September fifth, with the evaluation language and no promise for the remaining locations.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "colin-ellis",
      "sequence": 13,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:06:38.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:06:54.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 398000,
      "end_offset_ms": 414000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-13"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-14",
      "kind": "transcript",
      "text": "Good. We can support the evaluation, but I do not want anyone treating this as a precedent. Bring back a new request if the customer wants to expand after the thirty days.",
      "speaker_participant_id": "alex",
      "sequence": 14,
      "started_at": "2026-08-29T17:07:02.000Z",
      "ended_at": "2026-08-29T17:07:21.000Z",
      "start_offset_ms": 422000,
      "end_offset_ms": 441000,
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.99,
      "origin": "imported",
      "source_external_id": "demo-northstar-commercial-exception-turn-14"
    }
  ],
